<title>USA: Unicom Corp unit sets $300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Unicom Corp unit sets $300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from Commonwealth Edison, a unit of Unicom Corp, was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER COMMONWEALTH EDISON</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 01/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.809  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.41 PCT    PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 98 BP	CALLABLE	 NO</p>
<p>BORROWER COMMONWEALTH EDISON</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 01/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.908  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.638 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 112 BP     CALLABLE	 NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
